{
  "_about": [
    "The Gallery (gallery.html): a section an event, in the order given here (the newest first), written by tools/pages/build.mjs (npm run pages).",
    "Each event: key (its address on the page, gallery.html#<key>, and its folder, assets/gallery/<key>/); title; date, YYYY-MM-DD (or YYYY-MM), for the page's own markup; when, the date as shown; then what tools/gallery/make.mjs writes: photos (each src, w, h and its tile's tw, th; from: \"film\" for a picture taken from the event's film), film (src, w, h, length, and an optional caption; or, for a film too long to keep in the site, drive: its Google Drive file id, played from Drive, with poster, a picture of the event's to show until it is played) and clips.",
    "A new event: add it here with key, title, date and when, then run tools/gallery/make.mjs (tools/gallery/README.md)."
  ],
